ature_046 level_003 versus level_002, feature_061 level_003 versus level_002, feature_053 value contrast, and the tested heterogeneity interactions of feature_037 with feature_010, feature_002, feature_040 median split, and feature_038 high threshold, plus feature_027 interactions with feature_037, feature_010, and feature_002. The most informative next analysis is to run the registered feature_037-by-feature_024 interaction probe H117 and avoid further feature_063 or feature_003 refinement unless a comparison has clearly adequate cells and a strong rationale. Sparse deferred claims such as H104-H106 and H110 should remain low-confidence corroboration rather than central discoveries.",
