w it, so it should not be elevated as a broadly supported predictor. Feature_003 remains unresolved because its point estimates are often near threshold but lower bounds consistently fall below 0.15. The most informative next analyses are targeted strict clean feature_003 probes by feature_040 stratum and a strict clean feature_063 probe in the high feature_008 context. If one validation request remains, the exact strict clean feature_002 claim H131 is the highest-priority independent check to complete mutually separable validation of all four dominant markers.",
