im. H176 remains active for the analogous strict-clean older-age feature_027 test. Direct claims will be accepted only if each comparison cell has at least 20 observations and the signed 95% Welch lower bound exceeds +0.15 in the claimed direction. Interactions, if any are later run, are effect-modification probes only; rejection would not prove absence of modification. No independent validation requests remain, so all conclusions remain limited to this supplied observational dataset.",
